  "description": "Revenue intelligence for SaaS paywall conversion. Voltaire connects Stripe data, installs behavioral tracking into the codebase, and runs three AI agents on every /voltaire: timing analysis, cohort comparison, and churn tracking to surface where conversion is being lost and what to fix.",
